  "details": "Kind of a personal nitpick, but the bee emoji seems to be very big compared to most other emojis we have access to in VRChat. Seems to take up a lot more space when shooting the emoji out. I propose either cutting the size of the individual bees in half, or reducing the number & spread of the bees as they shoot out by at least half. This would be a good compromise to keep the bee emoji but also not make it take up a ton of space.",
